@program gtk3-text-input-test
@compositor kwin
# Simplified Chinese output, in an application using text-input:
# hime-gb-toggle (as hime-setup's button, and hime-sim/hime-trad; there is
# no tray on Wayland) switches it on and off while typing.
e a <space> @exec ../../src/hime-gb-toggle e a <space> @exec ../../src/hime-gb-toggle e a <space>
